## Original Content
El presidente de EEUU ha ordenado que se bajen las banderas a media asta.

## Summary
Donald Trump has expressed sorrow over the death of Dolly Parton and decreed a week of mourning in her honor. He ordered flags to be flown at half-staff as part of the tribute, stating that the world loves her.

## Key Points
- Trump lamented the death of Dolly Parton publicly.
- He decreed an official week of mourning in her honor.
- Flags were ordered to be lowered to half-staff as a gesture of respect.
- The mourning gesture underscores Dolly Parton's cultural significance.


